  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Since 2021, UN Women/OHCHR has advanced women&#x2019;s roles in governance, peace, and security in Bungoma and Vihiga counties with Embassy of Ireland&#x2019;s support. 2025 project seeks to strengthen women&apos;s involvement in leadership positions, by emphasizing their roles in decision-making processes related to governance, peace and security. This phase will empower women and communities to actively participate in conflict resolution at ward level, to reach women who are the furthest behind in their communities.</narrative>
  </description>
